---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'October 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Nursling — Privacy Policy"
  description="Nursling's privacy policy. Nursling has no account, no server and no analytics — every nursing you record stays on your device."
>

<header class="nav-shell">
  <nav class="nav-inner"> <a href="/" class="nav-logo">DF</a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="/nursling/">Nursling</a></li>
      <li><a href="/nursling/support/">Support</a></li>
      <li><a href="/">Portfolio</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>
</header>

<main class="doc">
  <div class="doc-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Nursling</span>
    <h1 class="doc-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="doc-meta">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>

    <p class="doc-lead">
      Nursling does not collect your data, because there is nowhere for it to go. There is no
      account, no server and no analytics in the app. Everything you record stays on your
      device.
    </p>

    <h2>What Nursling stores</h2>
    <p>
      Nursling stores the nursings you record — the start time, the duration, the side, and any
      correction you make afterwards — along with your settings, such as reminders, the dark-at-night
      preference, and an optional baby name. All of it is written to a local database on your
      device.
    </p>
    <p>
      That local data is included in your device's own backup, the same way any other app's
      local data is: your encrypted iPhone or iCloud backup on iOS, and your Google account's
      Android backup on Android, if you have backup turned on. Nursling itself does not upload it,
      sync it, or read it back from anywhere.
    </p>

    <h2>What Nursling does not do</h2>
    <ul class="doc-list">
      <li>No account, sign-up, email address, or login of any kind.</li>
      <li>No server. Nursling has no backend and makes no network requests to send your data.</li>
      <li>No analytics, telemetry, crash-reporting SDK, or usage tracking.</li>
      <li>No advertising, and no advertising identifiers.</li>
      <li>No third-party trackers or data brokers. Your data is never sold or shared, because it is never collected.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Health data</h2>
    <p>
      The nursings you record are personal and sensitive, and Nursling treats them that way: they
      stay on the device. Nursling does not read from or write to Apple Health or Health Connect,
      and it does not transmit your records anywhere.
    </p>

    <h2>Purchases</h2>
    <p>
      Nursling is free for your first 50 nurslings. Unlimited tracking is a single one-time
      purchase, handled entirely by Apple through the App Store on iPhone, and by Google through
      Google Play on Android. Nursling never sees or stores your payment details. The store tells
      the app only whether the unlock has been purchased. Your history and your CSV export remain
      available whether you buy or not.
    </p>
    <p>
      On Android, purchases go through Google Play's billing library, which Google requires for
      in-app purchases. That library sends Google its own diagnostics about the purchase service.
      It does not carry your nursings, and Nursling adds nothing to it. How Google handles that
      information is covered by Google's privacy policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Exporting and deleting your data</h2>
    <p>
      You can export everything you have recorded to a CSV file at any time, from Settings, and
      that export is free forever. Because your data lives only on your device, deleting the app
      deletes the data with it. You can also delete individual nursings inside the app.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      Nursling is intended for parents and caregivers, not for children. It does not knowingly
      collect information from anyone, of any age.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy changes, the updated version will be published on this page with a new date
      at the top. Nursling's approach — nothing leaves the device — is a design decision, not a
      setting, so any change here would be a change to the app itself.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about privacy in Nursling? Email <a href="mailto:hey@davidferreira.dev?subject=Nursling%20privacy">hey@davidferreira.dev</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="doc-note">
      Nursling is a log, not medical advice. For questions about feeding, weight gain or supply,
      talk to your pediatrician.
    </p>
  </div>
</main>

<footer class="footer">
  <p class="footer-links"> <a href="/nursling/">Nursling</a>
    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <a href="/nursling/support/">Support</a>
    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <a href="/">Portfolio</a>
  </p>
  <p>David Ferreira · Portugal · <span id="year"></span></p>
  <script>document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear().toString();</script>
</footer>

</Layout>

<style>
:root { --accent: #7C5CFF; --accent-2: #FF5CA8; }

/* ── Nav ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.nav-shell {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  background: rgba(13,15,26,0.85);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(237,233,226,0.07);
}
.nav-inner {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 2rem;
  height: 60px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.nav-logo {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ink);
  text-decoration: none;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 1.75rem;
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0; padding: 0;
}
.nav-links a {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--muted);
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: color 0.15s;
}
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

/* ── Document ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.doc { padding: 140px 0 100px; }
.doc-inner {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 2rem;
}
.eyebrow {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent-2);
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.doc-title {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  line-height: 1.1;
}
.doc-meta {
  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  color: rgba(237,233,226,0.30);
  margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
}
.doc-lead {
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: rgba(237,233,226,0.75);
  margin: 0 0 3rem;
  padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(237,233,226,0.08);
}
.doc-inner h2 {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 2.75rem 0 0.875rem;
  line-height: 1.25;
}
.doc-inner h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
.doc-inner p {
  font-size: 0.9875rem;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: rgba(237,233,226,0.55);
  margin: 0 0 1rem;
}
.doc-inner a {
  color: var(--ink);
  text-decoration: underline;
  text-underline-offset: 3px;
  text-decoration-color: rgba(124,92,255,0.85);
}
.doc-list {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0 0 1rem;
  padding: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.6rem;
}
.doc-list li {
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: rgba(237,233,226,0.65);
  padding-left: 1.25rem;
  position: relative;
}
.doc-list li::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0.62em;
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--accent);
}
.doc-note {
  margin-top: 3.5rem !important;
  padding-top: 2rem;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(237,233,226,0.08);
  font-size: 0.8125rem !important;
  color: rgba(237,233,226,0.30) !important;
}

/* ── Footer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.footer {
  background: var(--navy);
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(237,233,226,0.05);
  padding: 2rem;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  color: rgba(237,233,226,0.22);
}
.footer p { margin: 0; }
.footer-links {
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0.6rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.footer a {
  color: rgba(237,233,226,0.45);
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: color 0.15s;
}
.footer a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .doc { padding: 110px 0 72px; }
  .nav-links { gap: 1rem; }
}
</style>
